---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Natgenic" description="Natgenic privacy policy."><Header /><main class="legal-page"><div class="wrap legal-content"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1 class="h-xl">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 9 October 2026</p><p>This policy explains how Natgenic collects and uses information when you contact us or place an order through Instagram.</p><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>We may collect your name, delivery address, phone number, email address, order details and messages you send us. Payment information is handled by the payment method you choose; we do not ask you to send card details by email.</p><h2>How we use information</h2><p>We use your information to respond to enquiries, process and deliver orders, provide order updates, handle customer support and meet legal obligations.</p><h2>Sharing information</h2><p>We share only the information needed with delivery partners and service providers that help fulfil your order. We do not sell your personal information.</p><h2>Data retention and security</h2><p>We keep order and support information only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes above and legal record-keeping. We take reasonable steps to protect it, but no online transmission or storage method is completely secure.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may ask to access, correct or delete personal information we hold about you, subject to applicable law and records we need to retain. To make a request, contact us at <a href="mailto:natgenic.hairoil@gmail.com">natgenic.hairoil@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always appear on this page.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:natgenic.hairoil@gmail.com">natgenic.hairoil@gmail.com</a>.</p></div></main><Footer /></Layout>
